name    mod-dungeon-challenge: a Turtle dungeon lifted to level 80 (Crescent Grove)
# Server-side test bot run (mod-fl-testbots), T1. Mythic+ idea 9, in Turtle's Crescent Grove (802, levels 30-40,
# dungeon_challenge_scale.uplift_level 80) at challenge level 10 (health x1.5).
#   A Groveweald Warrior (930029, rank-1 elite, level 30-31, HealthModifier 3) goes to level 81 with the WotLK
#   base health (about 13000 x 3 x 1.5 = 58700; unlifted about 1500): above 50000.
#   Grovetender Engryss (930036, level 34, a boss through dungeon_challenge_boss_entry) goes to level 82:
#   13481 x 8.09 x 1.5 = 163650, above 150000.
timeout 180s

bot a warrior
group party

place 727 13288.5 11776.2 -31.5
require a alive
as gm .cheat god on
as gm .dchallenge start 802 10
waitfor gm map 802 timeout 20s
waitfor a map 802 timeout 20s
wait 2s

log trash - a warrior at level 81
do gm goto 410.0 -80.0 260.0
wait 3s
pick war creature:930029 near gm
require war exists
expect war maxhealth > 50000
do gm target war
as gm .dchallenge status
expect output has "level 81"
expect output has "boss no"

log boss - Grovetender Engryss at level 82
do gm goto 255.0 -140.0 277.0
wait 3s
pick eng creature:930036 near gm
require eng exists
expect eng maxhealth > 150000
do gm target eng
as gm .dchallenge status
expect output has "level 82"
expect output has "boss yes"

cleanup
as gm .cheat god off
place 727 13288.5 11776.2 -31.5
